THE CARRIER, ATTRIBUTED.  The final projection ALREADY partitions
(one_solve.feasibility_project_partitioned: airside pass carries no
groundside pair; groundside pass runs with every non-receiver frozen), so
the channel was never the constraint coupling — it is the SEED: the
airside pass re-projects from elev, and a groundside pass that rewrote an
airside-CLAIMED node hands it a different seed.  Fix at the entry point:
the limiter pins those nodes (layout.GROUNDSIDE_ROLES, the receiver rule,
both the 2-dp and the canonical identity).  Freezing airside INSIDE the
projection is refused — built and measured in the cycle-4 ingestion round
(HECA plateau airside 16,832 -> 40,902 held), noted in the code.

